      "en": "How long will you assault a man? Would all of you throw him down, like a leaning wall, like a tottering fence?",
      "ko": "넘어지는 담과 흔들리는 울타리 같은 사람을 죽이려고 너희가 일제히 박격하기를 언제까지 하려느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "a3699f44454bdd63993fc916606d004b0bb9691aad081ea6fa05eb38dab6a58c",
      "translation_text_hash": "a6353c4a563aa3e3f1c55d4dbe8ec3c707f9bae180afdbf5ff8463c6ede87dfe",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
