      "en": "They fully intend to throw him down from his lofty place. They delight in lies. They bless with their mouth, but they curse inwardly. Selah.",
      "ko": "저희가 그를 그 높은 위에서 떨어뜨리기만 꾀하고 거짓을 즐겨하니 입으로는 축복이요 속으로는 저주로다(셀라)",
      "source_text_hash": "9fc3031f13fc0f9100898c773e7145d705993ad2153ea04af44aee47caaa092c",
      "translation_text_hash": "7bd3552dfdabaa2c7933cab4ce308c31fd9f829a4c29510a59bf0f13a05d1c54",
